== invocations
success -> http=200 status=AVAILABLE | provider requests=1 | meters: attempts +1 outcomes +1 tokens +2 | audit rows +1 (NEXT_BEST_ACTION/GENERATED/NONE)
PASS  RES-10  success: 1 attempt, 1 outcome, 1 audit row
PASS  RES-10  success: token usage counted (reported by the response: 1 input + 1 output)
503 once then success (retry) -> http=200 status=AVAILABLE | provider requests=2 | meters: attempts +2 outcomes +1 tokens +2 | audit rows +1 (NEXT_BEST_ACTION/GENERATED/NONE)
PASS  RES-10  retry: attempts counted individually (2), exactly 1 outcome, 1 audit row
503 always -> http=200 status=AI_UNAVAILABLE | provider requests=2 | meters: attempts +2 outcomes +1 tokens +0 | audit rows +1 (NEXT_BEST_ACTION/FAILED/UNAVAILABLE)
PASS  RES-10  failure after retry: 2 attempts, 1 outcome, 1 audit row
PASS  RES-10  failed attempts add no token usage (none reported)
401 rejected -> http=200 status=AI_UNAVAILABLE | provider requests=1 | meters: attempts +1 outcomes +1 tokens +0 | audit rows +1 (NEXT_BEST_ACTION/FAILED/REJECTED_REQUEST)
PASS  RES-10  non-retryable failure: 1 attempt, 1 outcome, 1 audit row
model refusal -> http=200 status=AI_UNAVAILABLE | provider requests=1 | meters: attempts +1 outcomes +1 tokens +2 | audit rows +1 (NEXT_BEST_ACTION/FAILED/REFUSED)
PASS  RES-10  refusal: 1 attempt, 1 outcome, 1 audit row
gate rejection (rationale with a link) -> http=200 status=AI_UNAVAILABLE | provider requests=1 | meters: attempts +1 outcomes +1 tokens +2 | audit rows +1 (NEXT_BEST_ACTION/GATE_REJECTED/INVALID_RECOMMENDATION)
PASS  RES-10  gate rejection: 1 attempt, 1 outcome, 1 audit row (DENIED/INVALID_RECOMMENDATION)
denied caller (VIEWER) -> http=403 | attempts +0 audit rows +0
PASS  RES-10  denied before the provider: 0 attempts, 0 audit rows
